      "html": "<div class=\"pyq-source-text\">At a kindergarten, 2024 kids sit in a circle. Suddenly, each kid randomly pokes either<br>   the kid to their left or the one to their right. What is the expected number of unpoked<br>   kids?<br>   (a) 1                     (b) 253                      (c) 506                        (d) 1012</div>",
