      "html": "<div class=\"pyq-source-text\">Let L be a regular language, and let n = 10. Which of the following statements is<br>   true?<br><br>  (a) L ∪ {an bn } is regular<br>  (b) L ∪ {an bn } is context-free, but not regular<br>  (c) L ∪ {an bn } is regular, but not context-free<br>  (d) L ∪ {an bn } is not context-free<br><br>                                                   3</div>",
